  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>26</mn></mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>26</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p>and Input current&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mV</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>μA</mi></math><br /><br />we know,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo></math>&nbsp;Output current&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>250</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>μA</mi></math></p>",
